he intra-hour price path and its volume concentration where own and common hourly movement agree. Volume must improve both the endpoint-return control and a uniform-price-center ablation.","scope":"All550362 original evaluation anchors, unchanged five-minute spot target anchor+60 toanchor+360sec, identical frozen flat probabilities. Evaluate all9 cohorts and agreement subset selected solely from past inputs. Disagreement stays in full evaluation, no outcome-based row removal. Retain both original gates and fixed-bin calibration.","signals":"Each asset center displacement=-2*(current_logclose-center)/(causal prior60minute RMS*sqrt60), clipped+-8. Mean3asset displacement clipped+-3. Factor2 is fixed to approximately align a uniform linear path with the endpoint hourly displacement. No fitted weights or threshold search. Common/own sign agreement uses frozen hourly return definition. For disagreement/zero use old common signal; for agreement use respective market center signal.","status":"Sequential retrospective exploration of already explored Jan-Jul2024/2025/2026 BTC/ETH/SOL outcomes. Previous failures motivated hypothesis; no new candidate scores inspected before registration. Not independent/prospective confirmation.","uncertainty":"Unchanged thresholds. Conditional4000 paired7day bootstrap seed271032,99.444% intervals; accuracyLCB>50%, Brier/logloss gainLCB>0 vs named control AND frequency,>=5positive months,>=100each direction. Original52% selection and98.333% intervals unchanged. No joint correction across comparisons/subsets/endpoints/sequential studies; low dimensionality cannot prove absence of overfitting."}}
